      <guid>https://ezaurum.com/recipe/2013-11-24-move-today-git-bundle-to-backup/</guid>
      <description>date +%Y%m%d | xargs -i{} git bundle create {}.bundle &amp;ndash;all ; mv *.bundle [대상 디렉토리]</description>
